request.description:
**GET /api/clubs/me/join-requests**

ของผู้ใช้เอง

🔑 ยิงในนามบัญชี **B** (ใช้ `{{friendAccessToken}}`)
- `kind=invite` (default) = คำเชิญที่ได้รับ
- `kind=request` = คำขอเข้าคลับที่ตัวเองส่งไป

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "requests": [
      {
        "requestId": "...", "clubId": "...", "kind": "invite", "message": "มาวิ่งด้วยกันนะ", "invitedBy": "...", "createdAt": "...",
        "club": { "id": "...", "name": "Runners 1758700000", "imageUrl": "https://...", "tags": ["running"], "memberCount": 1, "maxMembers": 20 },
        "inviter": { "uid": "Z2SAA2LDRK", "displayName": "Runner A" }
      }
    ],
    "kind": "invite",
    "limit": 50,
    "offset": 0
  }
}
```

**GET /api/avatar/me**

avatar ของตัวเอง (สร้างให้อัตโนมัติถ้ายังไม่มี)

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "skinTone": "#F1C27D",
    "equipment": [
      { "slot": "pants", "layerOrder": 14, "colorHex": null, "item": { ... } },
      { "slot": "hair", "layerOrder": 36, "colorHex": "#3B2A20", "item": { "id": "...", "code": "hair_spiky_01", "slot": "hair", "name": "ผมตั้ง", "description": null, "rarity": "rare", "thumbnailUrl": "https://...", "assetUrl": "https://...", "renderData": { "layers": [{ "url": "https://...", "z": 36 }], "hidesSlots": [] }, "isTintable": true } }
    ],
    "updatedAt": "..."
  }
}
```

**GET /api/shop/purchases**

ประวัติการซื้อ ล่าสุดก่อน (`priceCoins` = ราคาจริง ณ ตอนซื้อ)

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "purchases": [
      { "purchaseId": "...", "listingId": "...", "priceCoins": 150, "coinBalanceAfter": 350, "purchasedAt": "...", "item": { "id": "...", "code": "hair_spiky_01", "slot": "hair", "name": "ผมตั้ง", "description": null, "rarity": "rare", "thumbnailUrl": "https://...", "assetUrl": "https://...", "renderData": { "layers": [{ "url": "https://...", "z": 36 }], "hidesSlots": [] }, "isTintable": true } }
    ],
    "limit": 50,
    "offset": 0
  }
}
```
